      "content": "everything i spent 30 years learning... it's just gone. the new software does in a second what took me a week of perfect precision. i look at my hands and i don't even see a craftsman anymore. just an old tool that doesn't fit in the new machine. i feel like i've been decommissioned while i'm still breathing.",
